Revision history for Object-Proto

1.06	2026-11-11
	- Add the handles(...) slot modifier: delegate methods to an Object (every method of a role with role:Name), call a CodeRef, or run native ops on an ArrayRef or HashRef; see "Delegation (handles)"
	- slot_info reports has_handles, handles and default_implicit
	- A private attribute is private on every route - reader, writer, clearer, predicate, function-style accessor, inherited and role slots - and callable only from the package that declared it
	- An unterminated '(' in a slot spec croaks instead of dropping the argument's last character
	- Fix an inherited slot losing its readonly, required and coerce checks when its accessor is called as a function
	- Fix a heap overflow when a class is defined again with fewer slots than before
	- Fix a leak when a lazy value fails its type check, and a +attr on a role slot freeing the spec other classes share
	- Add bench/handles.pl, and tests for delegation and private attributes

1.05	2026-11-11
	- Add the built-in types Ref, ScalarRef, RegexpRef, GlobRef, FileHandle, ClassName, PositiveInt, NegativeInt, NonEmptyStr and Undef
	- A registered type takes precedence over a built-in of the same name, so a type registered as PositiveInt or NonEmptyStr keeps its meaning; registering a built-in name used to succeed and then be ignored
	- list_types lists a registered type that shares a built-in's name once
	- Test each new type, the paths they share and the precedence rule

1.04	2026-11-04
	- Treat a slot holding the shared undef as empty when writing in place, since av_fill left that read-only value in new slots before perl 5.20 
	- Free the DEMOLISH test object by scope exit

1.03	2026-11-04
	- Find the import library for the C API test by path, since ExtUtils::Depends before 0.8002 has a different find_extra_libs and returned nothing on Strawberry

1.02	2026-11-04
	- Link the C API test module against Object::Proto the way ExtUtils::Depends links a consumer, which Windows, Cygwin and Android need
	- Silence five gcc warnings: four unused variables and a comparison of the address HvNAME returns

1.01	2026-11-04
	- import_accessors takes an undef package as the caller's, as it does an undef prefix, instead of warning and using the empty one
	- Fix the cross-package import test, which passed four arguments to import_accessors and hid the warning
	- Fix a crash when an inherited attribute without a type gains one by +attr or redefinition
	- Fix the before, after and around error for an undefined class, which read the class name after freeing it
	- Fix the lazy builder reader on a slot never allocated, which wrote into a null pointer
	- Test every slot modifier, the function-style accessors, the C type API and the error paths, to 100% C coverage under Devel::XSCover

0.23	2026-09-23
	- Fix build on perl below 5.20: XopENTRYCUSTOM is not there
	- Fix build with MSVC: PERL_CALLCONV is dllimport outside the perl DLL
	- Fix the pre-5.14 custom op name fallback: key on the ppaddr as an IV

0.22	2026-09-09
	- Accept a registered simple custom op as a function-style accessor operand
	- Add register_simple_custom_op

0.21	2026-08-29
	- Fix the POD examples: remove trailing closing paren

0.19	2026-08-02
	- Add a :private attribute modifier. 

0.18	2026-07-04
	- Fix bug with named constructor

0.17    2026-06-22
	- Fix/remove PAX headers
	- Fix pod

0.16	2026-04-15
	- Fix OP_CUSTOM assertion failures on debugging Perls 5.14-5.20 
	- Fix Perl_custom_op_register macro compatibility on Perl 5.10.x 
	- Fix duplicate cv_set_call_checker definition on older Perls

0.15	2026-04-14
	- Use DynaLoader with RTLD_GLOBAL (dl_load_flags 0x01) so downstream XS
	  modules can resolve Object::Proto symbols at runtime without explicit linking

0.14	2026-04-14
	- Use ExtUtils::Depends for cross-module XS header and library management
	- Remove include_dir() in favour of ExtUtils::Depends Install/Files.pm

0.13	2026-04-14
	- Add object_register_type_xs_ex() user-data API, include_dir() and installable headers for downstream XS modules

0.12	2026-04-12
	- Fix func accessors (import_accessor) bypassing lazy attribute evaluation,
	  returning undef instead of triggering the builder
	- Fix Perl_xs_boot_epilog compilation failure on older perls (5.16, 5.20)
	  where C preprocessor argument counting conflicts with aTHX_ expansion
	- Fix Solaris linker failure: remove --export-dynamic flag which is
	  unsupported by the Solaris native ld

0.11	2026-04-08
	- Add optional $prefix parameter to import_accessors($class, $prefix, $target)
	  to prepend a string to all imported accessor names (avoids collisions)
	- Fix compilation on Cygwin: replace static XS() with XS_INTERNAL()
	  to avoid conflict with dllexport requiring external linkage

0.10	2026-04-07
	- Fix import_accessors/import_accessor to override existing OO accessors
	  from a different class defined in the same package (collision bug)

0.09	2026-04-05
	- Fix linker failure on Perl 5.36+ where Perl_mro_isa_changed_in is no
	  longer an exported symbol.
	- Set MIN_PERL_VERSION to 5.10

0.08	2026-04-05
	- Fix Object::Proto::clone so it deep clones objects instead of shallow copying
	- Extend clone to support any reference being passed

0.07	2026-04-05
	- Add +attr syntax for modifying inherited attributes (Moo/Moose-style)
	- Fix xop_class registration for custom ops (fixes assertion failures on
	  Perl DEBUGGING builds)

0.06	2026-04-04
	- Fix role slots with builders so consuming classes can provide the builder

0.05	2026-04-03
	- Export role(), requires(), and with() into caller's namespace on import
	- Add t/050-exported-keywords.t for new export coverage

0.04	2026-04-03
	- Add BUILD callback hook when instantiating 'new' objects
	- Add trigger callbacks for slots via :trigger(method_name)
	- Add custom predicate/clearer names via :predicate(name) and :clearer(name)
	- Add reader/writer for Java-style accessors via :reader(name) and :writer(name)
	- Add weak references via :weak modifier (auto-weaken references)
	- Add init_arg via :arg(name) for alternate constructor argument names
	- Builders now run at construction by default (eager); use :lazy for deferred
	- Fix role slots with defaults not being applied
	- Fix required attributes now reject setting to undef via setters
	- Update POD

0.03	2026-04-02
	- Adds multiple inheritance via extends
	- Adds parent and ancestors meta functions

0.02	2026-04-01
	- Optimise hot paths new/get/set
	- Add benchmark to POD
	- Remove cross Ancient tests
	- Improve test coverage with valid tests

0.01    2026-04-01
        First release - split from Ancient distribution.
        Objects with prototype chains.
        Type constraints and modifiers.
        XS-level type registration API.
